think The round-open pull rebased four local commits onto ef8dd37a44 and conflicted once, on the ITINERARY git nib alone. Took the replaying commit's side; later commits re-pin it anyway.
think Council rota row 3485 mod 5 = 0 -- Aether, Jupiter, why the work exists. Read the threshold, follow-our-compass, the-lindy-effect, and the-grain-and-the-crossing. The strand seated at the grain's fusion is the one that shaped the whole lap: a guard that cannot red guards nothing, so every guard must be proven able to red by a plant the toothed form bites.
think Standfast first. Four rows stand open: %230 and %252 are GATE (row-number allocation, Keaton's word); %249 and %250 are the shell-dialect family the last lap's recommend line named. The recommend and the reds agree, which is the crux.
think The cold roster read 66 guards, 65 green, 1 red -- remember_git_nib, stale because the rebase rewrote every hash. Expected, and closed by pinning in this round's work commit rather than a pin-only follow-up.
think Read all twelve gated sites before writing anything. Two shapes only: xargs -a LIST CMD, and xargs -a LIST -d newline [-n 400] CMD. Both become tr newline null | xargs -0, which the scan's own prove-dialect leg had already shown surviving a BSD-shaped shim.
think Asked the system rather than guessing: invariant_coverage_control.sh COPIES its scan into a pen, so a sourced helper had to travel with it. Six other controls run their scan in place. Proven both ways -- with the helper the control reads 26 pass 0 fail, without it 0 pass 26 fail.
think Before repairing, reproduced the fault on this host: exec_bit_scan.sh reads directly_invoked=18 on GNU and 0 under an xargs refusing -a and -d, printing verdict=ok both times. The reading it ENFORCES at zero, directly_invoked_not_exec, was therefore vacuous on the macOS bench.
obs A meter counted its own prose. advisory_date_d first read 10 where the tree holds 9; the tenth was the witness's own assertion message, "want the date -d advisory printed". The scan already named this limit for comments and now names it for strings, and the message was reworded rather than the count accepted -- a number that instructs a reader to edit a sentence instructs nobody.
obs My first attempt to prove the vacuity guard did not bite. Appending garbage to the end of the planted script proved nothing, because sh parses incrementally and the script exits before reaching it. An empty plant is what actually fires the refusal, and that is the reading recorded.
obs A fresh git worktree read dated_path_repoint at 3 files where the main tree reads 25. The cause is uninitialised submodules -- 18 tracked files absent on disk -- so it is a machine fact, not a tree red. The control that matters is HEAD's own scan run in the main tree, which reads 25 and 59 exactly as the repaired one does.
obs The integration gate is carried forward rather than quietly crossed. REDS %248 reserved the two-pier merge for Keaton's word one lap ago and nothing this round overturned it, so main stays unpushed and this package parks additively beside the last.
